# Build a Claude Managed Agent on Vercel

Learn how to build a Claude Managed Agent on Vercel with auth, credential vaults, durable polling, and a chat UI.

[![](https://images.ctfassets.net/hjgychtc108g/tekSDrIlDfSLLE0YquGj6/52f56202b9d214f90a9021c4df08c9bc/T0CAQ00TU-U093PL8LXKK-35465c6cf81d-512.jpeg)Allen Zhou](https://x.com/allenzhou101)

